From b49a61cf17ca7467cf0084a7432b0237b0a2a1a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 21:59:54 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Early Game full pass: open roads, compass trail, living
 cast, UI density, chest props
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Past the pier and past tutorialDone — no quest IDs, gates, combat numbers
or locked systems changed.

- Graduation: Miss Ledger physically stamps an orientation slip
  (GraduationStamp); QUEST COMPLETE + reward fire on the hit, then harbour
  bells. Flushes on quit/world change/disable.
- Open Roads (OpenRoads + OpenRoadsGUI): Vex -> Rite Warden -> Craftsman
  side job -> Surveyor -> wider map, read from existing state. Ledger pins
  the next road and opens the board; return visits open it too. /guide and
  Discord guide lead with the roads after the stamp. Pinned roads persist
  in QuestHint until filed.
- TutorialQuestTrail compass mode: painted chevrons toward the READY
  turn-in NPC or the QuestHint target (QM, Foreman, Temper, Ledger, Fields,
  roads), only on walkable ground with headroom; NPC-colour beacon <64m.
- LivingNpcAtmosphere: Quartermaster, Craftsman, Temper, Farmer, Vex,
  Rite Warden, Surveyor ambient beats; NpcPresence voices for four more.
- Recipe Book: known counts, quiet empty categories, Ready-to-craft view,
  flat lists fold locked recipes into "+N more", softer undiscovered icon.
  Manager: open x/y, one glinting next unlock, far locks recede, rails.
- Craftsman: side job said plainly, craft nudge, small QUEST COMPLETE on
  payout, state-aware follow-up (no stale "Next: Foreman").
- Vex frames first hit (damage numbers / crits) and first kill once.
- UnlockToast gets the discover "world noticed you" ring.
- Explore chests are authored per-rarity Display props on a barrier
  hitbox: hinge lid, idle life, open/spin/close choreography, walk-up
  rattle, distant glint, first-sighting line. Legacy vanilla chests
  migrate in place; facing persisted; parts non-persistent and cleaned on
  remove/unload/disable. Dev Menu give path unchanged.
- German strings for the new lines; finish doc in BossEngine/docs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
